@startuml CurrentPrototype
title Current Prototype Architecture

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor User

package "Frontend (nginx)" {
    rectangle "React SPA" as UI
}

package "API (FastAPI)" {
    rectangle "REST API\n+ ProfilingScheduler\n+ JobDispatcher" as API
    database "PostgreSQL" as DB
}

package "Worker (FastAPI, per GPU node)" {
    rectangle "Job Worker\n(HTTP server)" as JobWorker
}

package "Execution" {
    rectangle "Docker\nContainers" as Docker
    folder "Checkpoints" as Checkpoints
    folder "Run logs" as Logs
}

' Interactions
User --> UI : submit/stop/resume
UI --> API : HTTP (CORS-gated)
API --> DB : connection pool\n(psycopg-pool)
API --> JobWorker : POST /jobs/{id}/run\nPOST /jobs/{id}/stop
JobWorker --> Docker : run containers
JobWorker --> DB : progress + status updates\nNOTIFY ijm_schedule
Docker --> Checkpoints : save/load
Docker --> Logs : stdout capture

note right of API
    • Job CRUD + pagination
    • Atomic stop/resume (no TOCTOU)
    • Image name validation
    • Path traversal protection
    • Health check (DB)
    • GPU-aware profiling scheduler
    • PG LISTEN/NOTIFY for instant wakeup
end note

note right of JobWorker
    • HTTP endpoints (FastAPI)
    • Concurrent job execution
    • Async subprocess (non-blocking)
    • State reconciliation on startup
    • Job timeout (configurable, default 24h)
    • NOTIFY scheduler on preempt/profiling done
    • GET /jobs/{id}/logs for log proxying
end note

note right of Docker
    • Resumable execution (checkpoints)
    • Profiling isolation (separate ckpt dir)

    → Evolves to: K8s Jobs / Pods
end note

note right of Checkpoints
    → Evolves to: S3 (distributed storage)
end note

@enduml
